"لإعادة تتبع مسار استكشافك"

#: C:/Users/Zoro/Pictures/file_analysis_data/templates/file/File_Management_Analysis_System.html:211
msgid ""
"Scalable Performance: Cursor-based pagination and efficient rendering "
"handle large datasets without performance issues"
